Z||000000||JohnnyK||01-17-2001||06:18 PM||||I'm having a problem with my 95 accord. It is really snarling loud, but after putting it into neutral and doing it (while coasting along), I've decided it's the tranny. I haven't got outside to look at the fluid, but what do you guys think it could be? Picture a 4banger, really snarling. In neutral, she sounds nice and "purrish". Plugged filter?||||reg||1
